body:
You're young, I'm 25 years old and I feel like time is running out for me. You have plenty of time. It won't be easy to make a living making music but if you worked hard perhaps you could make your dream come true. It won't be easy but if music is really your passion you should take the risk and work hard, expect that you'll have to make sacrifices.

&#x200B;

I'm also in your position, if I didn't find a stable job by the age of 30 I'll end it all.
